abstract: >-
  The sixth dimension is defined as a perceptual-representational coordinate,
  x6 = G, the internally generated share of a percept. The state criterion is
  D = 1 when G >= 0.70 and Q >= 0.80. The Cloud-Visibility Rule states
  V = 1 -> D = 0. Hypothesis and experimental protocol. No empirical data
  have been collected. No results are claimed. Ethics not yet approved.
